# Clash of the Eikons choosing one mode only, "Target creature you control fights target creature an opponent controls" (CR 701.14a):
# no mode at all is refused ("choose one or more"). Bot1's Cactuar (3/3) fights Bot2's Steel Wall (0/4): the Wall takes 3, the Cactuar
# none. Bot2's creature is no legal first target and Bot1's own Cactuar no legal second one. Bot1 pays {G} exactly with Mox Emerald.

[Bot1 Deck]
Clash of the Eikons
Cactuar
Mox Emerald
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Steel Wall
Mox Pearl
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cactuar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Steel Wall.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clash of the Eikons.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(Count: 0)
Bot1.Modes(1)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Cactuar)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Cactuar)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Steel Wall.Damage = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Cactuar.Damage = 0
